1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:02,541
Introduction

2
00:00:04,958 --> 00:00:08,750
The purpose of head and neck 
radiation is to treat your cancer.

3
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:15,083
An undesired effect of these treatments 
is skin damage or radiation dermatitis.

4
00:00:15,083 --> 00:00:18,208
As a small portion of the radiation doses accumulates

5
00:00:18,208 --> 00:00:20,958
to the outside of the skin throughout treatment.

6
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,583
What is radiation dermatitis?

7
00:00:23,583 --> 00:00:28,041
It is a reddening or pinking of the skin, 
kind of like a sunburn.

8
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:31,791
This can be painful and uncomfortable.

9
00:00:31,791 --> 00:00:37,000
 Almost all of our patients will experience 
some level of radiation dermatitis.
